                        ],
                        "form": "бау́ле"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "d85b809e-9747-4519-9f38-608b29de6266",
                        "entry_id": "0cebd26c-4d4e-3727-82d7-887f5a4a8320",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "бау́лах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "36ac5519-54f5-3199-ab7e-cddf3d5ee914",
                        "entry_id": "0cebd26c-4d4e-3727-82d7-887f5a4a8320",
                        "glosses": [
                            "большая мягкая дорожная сумка"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cafa00ba-883b-4402-b1e1-6fbc9eee46bd",
                                "sense_id": "36ac5519-54f5-3199-ab7e-cddf3d5ee914",
                                "text": "Маленькая смуглая женщина в узких брючках и огромном свитере перла на себе один такой раздувшийся баул, раскачиваясь под его весом из стороны в сторону, словно пьяная."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e34a1a20-5751-393f-90cd-79114d58d2fc",
                        "entry_id": "0cebd26c-4d4e-3727-82d7-887f5a4a8320",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. продолговатый дорожный сундучок"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1e03c7e1-00cd-40cb-a93c-3755766fa7b0",
                                "sense_id": "e34a1a20-5751-393f-90cd-79114d58d2fc",
                                "text": "Фанерный баул."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5379409b-6800-47f1-88bd-29a28d30bd8c",
                                "sense_id": "e34a1a20-5751-393f-90cd-79114d58d2fc",
                                "text": "Первое, что поразило его при входе в переднюю, был запах пачули, весьма ему противный; тут же стояли какие-то высокие сундуки и баулы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f37c1bc-c8eb-46b5-a813-f7143b28e6ab",
                                "sense_id": "e34a1a20-5751-393f-90cd-79114d58d2fc",
                                "text": "Своя прислуга, особое помещение в вагоне, бездна ненужных баулов, чемоданов и даже сундуков, прибывших с бабушкой, вероятно, послужили началом престижа;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91d202e7-23ba-4ce8-9b1d-76fd9921a5c6",
                                "sense_id": "e34a1a20-5751-393f-90cd-79114d58d2fc",
                                "text": "Мне один японец подарил маленький баул, обтянутый кожей акулы; очень красиво, похоже немного на тисненый сафьян."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8768aaf2-c5e2-4bdf-8c28-008b0c82bb28",
                                "sense_id": "e34a1a20-5751-393f-90cd-79114d58d2fc",
                                "text": "Прихожая, где висело темное зеркало с подставкой для перчаток и стоял дубовый баул, на который легко было наскочить коленом, суживалась в голый, очень тесный коридор."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7f5ce81f-f027-4299-a75f-d8fb4ee0cf82",
                        "source_entry_id": "0cebd26c-4d4e-3727-82d7-887f5a4a8320",
                        "source_sense_description": "сумка",
                        "target_lang_word": "portmanteau",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "portmanteau",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b678443-6e45-358f-8e89-1b57d7e0bda9",
                                        "entry_id": "0aad4bfb-a695-30fc-a4ce-af54bbbe134d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large travelling case usually made of leather, and opening into two equal sections."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7b022c2-07ed-4753-ab5f-9fb9fe766060",
                                                "sense_id": "7b678443-6e45-358f-8e89-1b57d7e0bda9",
                                                "text": "Rodolphus therefore finding such an earnest Invitation, embrac'd it with thanks, and with his Servant and Portmanteau, went to Don Juan's; where they first found good Stabling for their Horses, and afterwards as good Provision for themselves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a46915f3-f732-4028-9554-0c540b75efa9",
                                                "sense_id": "7b678443-6e45-358f-8e89-1b57d7e0bda9",
                                                "text": "He brought down with him to our haunted house a little cask of salt beef; for, he is always convinced that all salt beef not of his own pickling, is mere carrion, and invariably, when he goes to London, packs a piece in his portmanteau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db0e6608-8201-4cf9-b4fe-40e84d2d007a",
                                                "sense_id": "7b678443-6e45-358f-8e89-1b57d7e0bda9",
                                                "text": "I believe that people are like portmanteaux—packed with certain things, started going, thrown about, tossed away, dumped down, lost and found, half emptied suddenly, or squeezed fatter than ever, until finally the Ultimate Porter swings them on to the Ultimate Train and away they rattle. . . ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46da4f03-4bd6-3070-a91a-ea04110fee27",
                                        "entry_id": "0aad4bfb-a695-30fc-a4ce-af54bbbe134d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A schoolbag."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4b3c94e-5228-3f2c-b884-8fc36ed6247e",
                                        "entry_id": "0aad4bfb-a695-30fc-a4ce-af54bbbe134d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hook on which to hang clothing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "457cff76-7b52-4623-8f50-b1f08e5ff67a",
                                                "sense_id": "c4b3c94e-5228-3f2c-b884-8fc36ed6247e",
                                                "text": "But before I started that long and rather far-fetched and not frightfully original digression, what I meant to say quite simply was that there are no portmanteaux to be examined here because the clientele of this café, ladies and gentlemen, does not sit down."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "portmanteau",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8101b32b-60d0-33fe-9c1c-e026ab3d4a41",
                                        "entry_id": "34d95aca-1dec-3759-9192-4b5ffbd185b2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Made by combining two (or more) words, stories, etc., in the manner of a linguistic portmanteau."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55259124-b0a9-4ce9-87d1-60ddd23794a9",
                                                "sense_id": "8101b32b-60d0-33fe-9c1c-e026ab3d4a41",
                                                "text": "The overall narrator of this portmanteau story - for Dickens co-wrote it with five collaborators on his weekly periodical, All the Year Round - expresses deep, rational scepticism about the whole business of haunting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82a00c44-5426-478c-a6c6-7b0bfda4b7a3",
                                                "sense_id": "8101b32b-60d0-33fe-9c1c-e026ab3d4a41",
                                                "text": "We're so bombarded with images, it's a struggle to preserve our imaginations.' In response, he's turned to cinema, commissioning 11 film-makers to contribute to a portmanteau film, entitled '11'09\"01' and composed of short films each running 11 minutes, nine seconds and one frame."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "portmanteau",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5f7df2a7-ea84-3196-8392-6fa86d663b2d",
                                        "entry_id": "9a125a3f-e2cc-3456-9725-97ec27204e46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A word formed by putting two words together and thereby their meaning e.g. shrinkflation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "994bd9b8-cbc7-4882-a822-5b7f9bd97750",
                                                "sense_id": "5f7df2a7-ea84-3196-8392-6fa86d663b2d",
                                                "text": "Well then, ‘mimsy’ is ‘flimsy and miserable’ (there’s another portmanteau for you)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb7cd90a-ac19-304c-adda-3613ebdfa621",
                                        "entry_id": "9a125a3f-e2cc-3456-9725-97ec27204e46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A portmanteau film."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b074b312-76a2-4000-8580-e99018b35f63",
                                                "sense_id": "eb7cd90a-ac19-304c-adda-3613ebdfa621",
                                                "text": "His long-awaited portmanteau, which premiered in Cannes on Monday, is the most Anderson of all Anderson films. It's Anderson distilled, Anderson squared, Anderson to the nth degree."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "portmanteau",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca4f68ab-1e19-3792-948e-f24e99086c70",
                                        "entry_id": "2f5b9e61-1334-3a61-9144-3048ca9ab939",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To create a portmanteau word."
                                        ],
